\newlabel{tab:abl_a2}{{6}{11}{Ablation A2 ($\times 4$): incremental confidence-aware routing components. PSNR(dB) mean$\pm $std (Y channel) over three seeds. The full configuration (v4) is clearly the best on both benchmarks, but the intermediate steps are not monotone; the components are mutually compatible and best as a complete confidence-aware path rather than individually accuracy-additive}{table.caption.37}{}}
