\newlabel{tab:abl_a3}{{7}{11}{Ablation A3 ($\times 4$): prototype balance loss. Reconstruction PSNR(dB) and block-averaged normalized prototype-usage entropy on Urban100 (higher $=$ more balanced), each reported as mean$\pm $std over three seeds. The balance loss raises usage entropy while also \emph {reducing seed-to-seed variance} on both benchmarks and on the usage entropy itself, supporting the stabilizing role claimed for C4}{table.caption.38}{}}
